From 0f1597509ea6ad0ba7fa174f75dcc1ad66224a55 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: albanread <albanread@googlemail.com>
Date: Sat, 19 Sep 2026 04:36:30 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] OpenSSL, CA certificates, bc and wget in the image

The minimum profile asks for openssl3, bc and wget (build/jam/
DefaultBuildProfiles), and the build printed "not available!" for each and
went on without them: Haiku's package server has none of the three for
arm64. They are built in prose-packages now, and so are what they need
beyond the image's packages: ca_root_certificates and zstd for OpenSSL,
gettext's libintl for wget. Listed here, the build adds openssl3, bc and
wget because the profile names them, and the rest through its dependency
resolution.

The ca_root_certificates entry replaces upstream's (2025_12_02-1, whose
file was never here) with the version the recipes build (2026_07_16-1).

The openssl3 build is the one from HaikuArmQemu's overlay: a haiku-aarch64
target, no CPU probing, hardware AES/SHA.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Prose-Patch: 0041-openssl-ca-certificates-bc-and-wget-in-the-image.patch a2e5bc41d33c7d0fffc079c423b5bd262762443d6a2870aba0425ba48f158237
---
 build/jam/repositories/HaikuPorts/arm64 | 12 +++++++++---
 1 file changed, 9 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/build/jam/repositories/HaikuPorts/arm64 b/build/jam/repositories/HaikuPorts/arm64
index 996609cad1..46980d1378 100644
--- a/build/jam/repositories/HaikuPorts/arm64
+++ b/build/jam/repositories/HaikuPorts/arm64
@@ -3,7 +3,8 @@ RemotePackageRepository HaikuPorts
 	: https://eu.hpkg.haiku-os.org/haikuports/master/build-packages
 	:
 	# architecture "any" packages
-	ca_root_certificates-2025_12_02-1
+	# from prose-packages (the server has no arm64 snapshot of this list)
+	ca_root_certificates-2026_07_16-1
 	haikuporter-0_bootstrap-1
 	noto-20170202_bootstrap-7
 	:
@@ -41,12 +42,14 @@ RemotePackageRepository HaikuPorts
 	texinfo-7.2_bootstrap-1
 	zlib-1.2.13_bootstrap-1
 	zlib_devel-1.2.13_bootstrap-1
-	# built in prose-packages, vendor rewritten by HaikuArmQemu
-	# private_workspace/addpkg.sh (resolved from generated/download/)
+	# built in prose-packages; HaikuArmQemu scripts/local-packages.sh puts
+	# them in generated/download/ (the server has no arm64 snapshot of this list)
+	bc-1.07.1-2
 	dav1d-1.5.4-2
 	dav1d_devel-1.5.4-2
 	flac-1.5.0-1
 	flac_devel-1.5.0-1
+	gettext_libintl-1.0-1
 	giflib-5.2.2-1
 	giflib_devel-5.2.2-1
 	lame-3.100-4
@@ -74,6 +77,7 @@ RemotePackageRepository HaikuPorts
 	mpg123_devel-1.32.9-1
 	openjpeg-2.5.4-1
 	openjpeg_devel-2.5.4-1
+	openssl3-3.5.8-2
 	opus-1.3.1-2
 	opus_devel-1.3.1-2
 	speex-1.2.1-2
@@ -84,6 +88,8 @@ RemotePackageRepository HaikuPorts
 	tiff_devel-4.7.0-1
 	wavpack-5.5.0-3
 	wavpack_devel-5.5.0-3
+	wget-1.24.5-2
+	zstd-1.5.7-1
 	:
 	# source packages
 	bash
